# Fictional authenticated wallet; no Privy account, transfer, signing or order.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es walletFixture demo
wait 1500
expect FICTIONAL WALLET DEMO
expect Create your wallet
expect No wallet address yet
shot hunch-wallet-before
scrollto Create Hunch wallet
tap Create Hunch wallet
expect Wallet ready
expect 0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111
scrollto Your verified balances
expect Arbitrum USDC: 12.50 USDC
expect Hyperliquid spot available: 0 USDC
shot hunch-wallet-balances
scrollto Refresh wallet and balances
tap Refresh wallet and balances
expect Copy wallet address
scrollto Copy wallet address
tap Copy wallet address
expect Wallet address copied
shot hunch-wallet-copy
rotate landscape
expect Your wallet
shot hunch-wallet-landscape
rotate portrait
expect Your wallet
scrollto Back to markets
tap Back to markets
expect PUBLIC MARKETS
[phone] Owner signs in using real email OTP and optional passkey. In Money > Add money, create/reopen Hunch wallet. Confirm same address on refresh/reopen, scan QR against displayed address, compare copied address and native USDC/ETH and Hyperliquid balances. Stop before funding or trading: owner performs all real money tests. Never disclose tokens or private keys.
